        "message": "=<p>Dear {{ $('8. Rule-Based + AI Assessment').item.json.candidate.name }},</p>\n<p>Thank you for applying for the <b>{{ $('8. Rule-Based + AI Assessment').item.json.candidate.jobRole }}</b> position. We're pleased to let you know that you've been <b>shortlisted</b> to move forward in our hiring process. Our team will reach out shortly to schedule the next step.</p>\n<p>Best regards,<br>Recruitment Team</p>",
